      "content": "i don't know if i can just \"bear\" it. it feels like half of me died with him. the world just looks gray now. i keep thinking... if he's gone, then where am i supposed to go? it feels like we were supposed to be together, forever. it's just so unfair that he's there and i'm stuck here in this nothingness.",
